"要儲存嗎？"

#: kiconedit.cpp:251
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "新視窗(&W)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:254
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new icon editor window."
msgstr ""
"新視窗\n"
"\n"
"開啟新圖示編輯器視窗。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:257
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon, either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"新增\n"
"\n"
"新建圖示，可使用樣板或具體指定大小"

#: kiconedit.cpp:261
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"開啟\n"
"\n"
"開啟已有的圖示"

#: kiconedit.cpp:269
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"儲存\n"
"\n"
"儲存目前的圖示"

#: kiconedit.cpp:274
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon."
msgstr ""
"列印\n"
"\n"
"打開列印對話框以列印目前的圖示。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:282
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"剪下\n"
"\n"
"剪下目前圖示的選出部份。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：可同時選擇矩形與圓形）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:286
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"複製\n"
"\n"
"複製目前圖示的選出部份。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：可同時選擇矩形與圓形）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:290
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents are larger than the current icon you can paste them in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparency.)"
msgstr ""
"貼上\n"
"\n"
"將剪貼簿的內容貼上到目前的圖示。\n"
"\n"
"如果剪貼簿的內容大於現在的圖形，你可以將它貼至新視窗。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：如果您要貼上透明像素，你可以在設定對話框選擇「貼上透明像素」。）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:298
msgid "Paste as &New"
msgstr "貼上成新的(&N)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:307
msgid "Resi&ze..."
msgstr "更改大小(&Z)..."

#: kiconedit.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"更改大小\n"
"\n"
"保持內容完整的同時平滑地改變圖形的大小"

#: kiconedit.cpp:315
msgid "&GrayScale"
msgstr "灰階(&G)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:318
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"灰階\n"
"\n"
"將目前圖示灰階化。\n"
"\n"
"（警告：產生的圖形很可能含有圖示的色盤中沒有的顏色）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:325
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one."
msgstr ""
"放大\n"
"\n"
"放大一倍。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:329
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one."
msgstr ""
"縮小\n"
"\n"
"縮小一倍。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:333
msgid "&Zoom"
msgstr ""

#: kiconedit.cpp:337
msgid "100%"
msgstr "100%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:343
msgid "200%"
msgstr "200%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:349
msgid "500%"
msgstr "500%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:355
msgid "1000%"
msgstr "1000%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:375
msgid "Show &Grid"
msgstr "顯示格線(&G)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:378
msgid "Hide &Grid"
msgstr "隱藏格線(&G)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:379
msgid ""
"Show grid\n"
"\n"
"Toggles the grid in the icon edit grid on/off"
msgstr ""
"顯示格線\n"
"\n"
"切換圖示編輯區的格線開關"

#: kiconedit.cpp:386
msgid "Color Picker"
msgstr "顏色選取器"

#: kiconedit.cpp:390
msgid ""
"Color Picker\n"
"\n"
"The color of the pixel clicked on will be the current draw color"
msgstr ""
"顏色選取器\n"
"\n"
"點按的像素顏色將成當前的畫畫顏色"

#: kiconedit.cpp:395
msgid "Freehand"
msgstr "徒手"

#: kiconedit.cpp:399
msgid ""
"Free hand\n"
"\n"
"Draw non-linear lines"
msgstr ""
"徒手\n"
"\n"
"徒手畫一非直線"

#: kiconedit.cpp:406
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "矩形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:410
msgid ""
"Rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a rectangle"
msgstr ""
"矩形\n"
"\n"
"畫一矩形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:414
msgid "Filled Rectangle"
msgstr "填滿的矩形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:418
msgid ""
"Filled rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled rectangle"
msgstr ""
"填滿的矩形\n"
"\n"
"畫一填滿的矩形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:422
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "圓形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:426
msgid ""
"Circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a circle"
msgstr ""
"圓形\n"
"\n"
"畫一圓形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:430
msgid "Filled Circle"
msgstr "填滿的圓形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:434
msgid ""
"Filled circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled circle"
msgstr ""
"填滿的圓形\n"
"\n"
"畫一填滿的圓形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:438
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "橢圓"

#: kiconedit.cpp:442
msgid ""
"Ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw an ellipse"
msgstr ""
"橢圓\n"
"\n"
"畫一橢圓"

#: kiconedit.cpp:446
msgid "Filled Ellipse"
msgstr "填滿的橢圓"

#: kiconedit.cpp:450
msgid ""
"Filled ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled ellipse"
msgstr ""
"填滿的橢圓\n"
"\n"
"畫一填滿的橢圓"

#: kiconedit.cpp:454
msgid "Spray"
msgstr "噴霧"

#: kiconedit.cpp:458
msgid ""
"Spray\n"
"\n"
"Draw scattered pixels in the current color"
msgstr ""
"噴霧\n"
"\n"
"以當前顏色繪畫散落的像素"

#: kiconedit.cpp:463
msgid "Flood Fill"
msgstr "填滿"

#: kiconedit.cpp:467
msgid ""
"Flood fill\n"
"\n"
"Fill adjoining pixels with the same color with the current color"
msgstr ""
"填滿\n"
"\n"
"用當前的顏色填滿鄰接的像素"

#: kiconedit.cpp:472
msgid "Line"
msgstr "線段"

#: kiconedit.cpp:476
msgid ""
"Line\n"
"\n"
"Draw a straight line vertically, horizontally or at 45 deg. angles"
msgstr ""
"線段\n"
"\n"
"畫一垂直線、水平線、或45度線"

#: kiconedit.cpp:481
msgid "Eraser (Transparent)"
msgstr "橡皮擦（透明化）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:485
msgid ""
"Erase\n"
"\n"
"Erase pixels. Set the pixels to be transparent\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: If you want to draw transparency with a different tool, first click on "
"\"Erase\" then on the tool you want to use)"
msgstr ""
"清除\n"
"\n"
"清除像素。將像素設成透明的\n"
"\n"
"（提示：如果您想要用不同的工具來繪畫透明度，先按下「清除」再選取您要用的工"
"具）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:492
msgid "Rectangular Selection"
msgstr "矩形選取"

#: kiconedit.cpp:496
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a rectangular section of the icon using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"選取\n"
"\n"
"使用滑鼠在圖示上選取矩形。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:501
msgid "Circular Selection"
msgstr "圓形選取"

#: kiconedit.cpp:505
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a circular section of the icon using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"選取\n"
"\n"
"使用滑鼠在圖示上選取圓形。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:533
msgid ""
"Statusbar\n"
"\n"
"The statusbar gives information on the status of the current icon. The "
"fields are:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Application messages\n"
"\t- Cursor position\n"
"\t- Size\n"
"\t- Zoom factor\n"
"\t- Number of colors"
msgstr ""
"狀態列\n"
"\n"
"狀態列提供目前圖示的資訊。欄位有:\n"
"\n"
"\t- 應用程式訊息\n"
"\t- 游標位置\n"
"\t- 大小\n"
"\t- 縮放倍率\n"
"\t- 顏色數"

